---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy \u2014 CA Mayank Wadhera" description="How camayankwadhera.com handles enquiry details." current="privacy">
<section class="hero page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:28px">
      <p><span class="confirm">Draft outline only. To be replaced with a reviewed privacy notice before launch.</span></p>
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>The enquiry form collects the details you type into it: your name, email, organization, country and the description of your need.</p>
      <h2>How it is used</h2>
      <p>Enquiry details are used to respond to you and to pass your enquiry to the venture or professional contact best placed to help.</p>
      <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
      <p>Enquiries are sent through Google Apps Script and stored in a private Google Sheet. Case studies on this site never include client names or details unless the client has approved it.</p>
      <h2>Still to be stated</h2>
      <p>Who the data controller is, how long enquiries are kept, which analytics are used, and how to request deletion.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
